1
00:00:00,540 --> 00:00:04,180
(Raj:)This says you can make
"end of life" decisions for me.

2
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:08,050
(Sheldon:)As your friend, let's hope it
doesn't come to that.

3
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:09,250
(Sheldon:)Please sign.

4
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:11,090
(Raj:)Did you sign this?

5
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:12,620
(Leonard:)There's a reciprocity
clause.

6
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:14,490
(Leonard:)You get to pull
the plug on him, too.

7
00:00:15,790 --> 00:00:18,830
(Raj:)Well, that seems fair.

8
00:00:18,830 --> 00:00:22,360
(Sheldon:)Congratulations and welcome
temporarily aboard.

9
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:23,900
(Sheldon:)Here's your I.D. card,

10
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:28,840
(Sheldon:)your key and your lapel pin.

11
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:31,370
(Sheldon:)Which Leonard was
too cool to wear.

12
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:37,240
(Sheldon:)FYI, part of your
responsibilities

13
00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:39,850
(Sheldon:)as roommate pro tem
will be to drive me

14
00:00:39,850 --> 00:00:42,650
(Sheldon:)to and from work, the comic book
store, the barbershop

15
00:00:42,650 --> 00:00:47,120
(Sheldon:)and the park for one hour every
other Sunday for fresh air.

16
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:49,760
(Leonard:)Bring a ball or a Frisbee,

17
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:52,060
(Leonard:)you know, something
he can chase.

18
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:55,300
(Sheldon:)Also, you're tasked
with bringing home

19
00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:56,460
(Sheldon:)all takeout dinners.

20
00:00:56,460 --> 00:00:57,830
(Sheldon:)Tonight is Thai food.

21
00:00:57,830 --> 00:01:00,470
(Sheldon:)You'll find the standard order
in appendix B

